&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;9rj1c-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;As a Principal Value Engineer at Elastic, you will have the chance to significantly influence our growth by partnering directly with our Enterprise and Strategic clients. Your role will be vital in helping these clients understand and leverage the full potential of our solutions, contributing to lasting relationships and the overall success of our company. If you have a background as a Value Engineer, Management Consultant, or a related customer facing role and enjoy working collaboratively in a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r1d:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;9rj1c-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;fast-paced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;9rj1c-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; environment, we would be excited to connect with you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;c8bg0&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;4mv09-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;4mv09-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4mv09-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Assess the value proposition of solutions to highlight their benefits for clients. Quantify the potential ROI of proposed implementations and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r1f:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4mv09-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;analyze&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4mv09-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; business challenges to recommend tailored solutions. Prepare and present findings to stakeholders and facilitate workshops to explore solution benefits and align on value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;c8bg0&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;a6nd1-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;a6nd1-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;a6nd1-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Engage with cross-functional teams to identify client needs and explore solution opportunities. Collaborate on proposal development to align value across the organization, ensuring a unified approach to client success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;c8bg0&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;f9rir-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;f9rir-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;f9rir-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Develop and execute value delivery strategies tailored for clients to maximize their experience. Monitor and report on the success of these initiatives, providing insights to optimize current value propositions. Facilitate client workshops to ensure clear alignment on goals and evaluate processes to enhance client satisfaction and value realization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;c8bg0&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;52odi-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;52odi-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;52odi-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Lead the development of thorough business value reviews for key initiatives. Create detailed business cases to guide strategic investments and resource allocation. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r1h:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;52odi-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Analyze&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;52odi-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; market data and client feedback to enhance the value review outcomes, and facilitate discussions with stakeholders to gather insights. Present the findings and business cases to executive &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r1j:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;52odi-3-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;52odi-4-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; and key stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
